ariable is called 'secs')~%# * stamp.nsec: nanoseconds since stamp_secs (in Python the variable is called 'nsecs')~%# time-handling sugar is provided by the client library~%time stamp~%#Frame this data is associated with~%string frame_id~%~%~%"))
